codex
Completed and verified as a Track B family based on the paper’s Section 4 pseudo-moment construction. The paper’s worst-case theorem is not misrepresented as distributional Track A hardness. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.11545)

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000 from 12,551,759,587,422 candidates.
- Reference Gaussian elimination: 17,944 field operations per instance.
- Compact intended route: 95 operations.
- Oracle results: bare 0/3, structural hint 0/3, placebo 0/3.
- Shipping preset: `easy`, `n=47`.

